defs[4	]{id	term	type	def	ex	tags}:
  d001	Canonical JSON	concept	The normalized JSON structure produced before TOON encoding.	A glossary becomes repeated `defs` records with stable fields.	schema,intermediate,validation
  d002	Lossless Mode	concept	Conversion mode that keeps the source meaning and text content inside the selected compact schema.	Prose sections keep their paragraph text instead of summarizing it.	mode,preservation
  d003	Record Mode	concept	Conversion mode that prefers typed repeated records for definitions, requirements, and table-like content.	"A set of terms becomes `defs[N]{id,term,type,def,ex,tags}`."	mode,structured
  d004	Budget Refusal	concept	The safety behavior that stops a budget conversion when the requested target cannot be reached losslessly.	A ten-character target fails unless `--allow-lossy` is explicitly passed.	budget,safety
